    {
      "@type": "NewsArticle",
      "headline": "Vishwashanti Gurukul World School Receives Official Authorization from IBO to Offer International Baccalaureate Career-related Programme",
      "articleBody": "Vishwashanti Gurukul World School is proud to announce that it has officially received confirmation and authorization from the International Baccalaureate® Organisation (IBO) to offer the International Baccalaureate Career-related Programme (IBCP). This milestone reinforces the school's commitment to academic excellence, holistic development, and global education.\n\nThe IBCP is a framework designed to equip students with both academic knowledge and practical career skills. With this authorization, Vishwashanti Gurukul World School joins institutions worldwide dedicated to fostering critical thinking, ethical leadership, and lifelong learning.\n\nThe announcement was marked by a moment where the school principal, alongside the IBCP coordinator, displayed the official letter received from the IBO.\n\nSpeaking on this achievement, the Principal (Mr. Arpit Sharma) said: \"We are deeply honoured to receive this authorization from the International Baccalaureate® Organisation. The International Baccalaureate Career-related Programme aligns perfectly with our vision of nurturing well-rounded, future-ready learners. This recognition reflects our commitment to providing a transformative education that empowers students to pursue their passions while building strong academic foundations. We are excited to embark on this new chapter of excellence.\"",
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Vishwashanti Gurukul World School (VGWS)",
        "url": "https://mitgurukul.com"
      },
      "quote": [
        "We are deeply honoured to receive this authorization from the International Baccalaureate® Organisation. The International Baccalaureate Career-related Programme aligns perfectly with our vision of nurturing well-rounded, future-ready learners. This recognition reflects our commitment to providing a transformative education that empowers students to pursue their passions while building strong academic foundations. We are excited to embark on this new chapter of excellence."
